// BICP Full Protocol Stack
// Stack: DL -> TL -> NL -> AL
//
// Use this for the original BICP implementation with all layers.
// Entry point: dl_frame
//
// Layer structure:
//   DL: CRC protection
//   TL: Reliable delivery with ACK/retransmit
//   NL: Fragmentation/reassembly
//   AL: Device multiplexing

version 1.0
endian le

include "dl.coco"
